    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82051ac9584cdc1cb2546476",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然决定要去的话，我们就快点出发吧。\n居然能让训练员那么想去，\n我也开始对那间店有点好奇了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d510e0e6e559adac536ded4d051855cfb2480f0dc5be7512efc46c4f5215cbd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
