      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "欢迎光临，北港火山小姐！！\n您今天能光临本店，我感到非常荣幸！！\n也非常感谢训练员！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9d433305cb6381c2bcde64b700b47f032d3b82f8951637a2988a8756d77c55a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
